数据来源说明 / Data Attribution

本项目展示的数据全部来自第三方权威机构的公开报告（详见 `data/*.json` 中每条数据的 `source` 和 `url` 字段）。
数据本身不归本项目所有，使用时请遵循各原始来源的版权与使用条款。

All data displayed in this project comes from publicly available reports by
third-party authoritative institutions (see the `source` and `url` fields in
each entry under `data/*.json`). The data itself is not owned by this
project; please follow the copyright and usage terms of each original source
when reusing it.
